#### 2.1.3 L2 路由规则示例

```rust
// "find all TODO comments" -> AtomicSearch
KeywordRule::new(
    r"(find|search|grep).*TODO",
    AtomicTool::Search(SearchAction {
        pattern: SearchPattern::Regex(r"TODO:.*"),
